Focal 8 (1969)

This patched version of Focal-69 has two differences:

Location FSINC9+1 is patched from 2401 to 2501, fixing an inaccuracy in a
constant used to compute FSIN().

Location 7500 is patched from 5230 to 4557, apparently to keep the checksum
the same (why is that important?).
